        <div class="colStructure">
            <p class="cPara">
                Nearest locations

                Currently, there are no Culver’s locations in Oklahoma, 
                with the nearest restaurants located in Kansas, Arkansas, and Texas. 
                Although Oklahoma City is expected to welcome its first Culver’s in early 2027, 
                Stillwater residents would still have to travel a considerable distance to enjoy one. 
                Opening a Culver’s in Stillwater would fill this retail gap,
                eliminating the inconvenience of long drives and providing residents 
                and OSU students with a convenient local option.
            </p>
            
            <img src="~/photos/culversokc.jpg" class="picRes" alt="Culver's OKC Location" />
        
        </div>

       
